# Class: resource:CHEMINF_000194 (acid dissociation constant)

AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description resource:CHEMINF_000194 "the acid dissociation constant, Ka, is quantitative measure of the strength of an acid in solution. It is the equilibrium constant for a chemical reaction known as dissociation in the context of acid-base reactions.")
