AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description resource:CHEMINF_000224 "Bond dissociation Gibbs energy descriptor captures the Gibbs energy associated with the process of breaking the bond in question. This could be measured or calculated in vacuo or in a specific Solvent, at a given temperature and pressure. Depends on molecular conformation.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label resource:CHEMINF_000224 "bond dissociation Gibbs energy descriptor")
