# Class: resource:CHEMINF_000225 (solvation Gibbs energy descriptor)

AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description resource:CHEMINF_000225 "The molecular entity solvation Gibbs energy descriptor reflects the Gibbs energy associated with the solvation of the molecular entity in question. This could be measured or calculated in vacuo or in a specific solvent, at a particular temperature and pressure. Depends on molecular conformation when computed.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label resource:CHEMINF_000225 "solvation Gibbs energy descriptor")
