# Class: resource:CHEMINF_000235 (disposition to dissociate)

AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description resource:CHEMINF_000235 "The disposition to dissociate is the disposition of an ionic compound (complexes, or salts) to separate or split into smaller particles, ions, or radicals, usually in a reversible manner.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label resource:CHEMINF_000235 "disposition to dissociate")
SubClassOf(resource:CHEMINF_000235 resource:CHEMINF_000404)

# Class: resource:CHEMINF_000236 (charge density)

