# Class: resource:CHEMINF_000238 (meltability)

AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description resource:CHEMINF_000238 "The meltability of a chemical substance is a quality which inheres in the chemical substance by virtue of the ease with which the substance can be changed from a solid to a liquid state especially by the application of heat.")
