# Class: resource:CHEMINF_000246 (size of largest chain)

AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description resource:CHEMINF_000246 "The largest chain size descriptor is a count descriptor that gives the integer length (number of atoms) in the largest chain in a molecular entity.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label resource:CHEMINF_000246 "size of largest chain")
