# Class: resource:CHEMINF_000251 (logP descriptor)

AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description resource:CHEMINF_000251 "The logarithm of octanol-water partition coefficient, which is the ratio of the molecules dissolved in octanol to those dissolved in pure un-ionized water upon mixture equilibration. This can be measured or predicted. The value is dimensionless. May depend on molecular conformation when computed.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label resource:CHEMINF_000251 "logP descriptor")
SubClassOf(resource:CHEMINF_000251 resource:CHEMINF_000025)
SubClassOf(resource:CHEMINF_000251 resource:CHEMINF_000513)
