# Class: resource:CHEMINF_000253 (refractive index descriptor)

AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description resource:CHEMINF_000253 "Chemical substance refractive index descriptor is a unitless descriptor that specifies the ratio of the speed of light in vacuum to that in a given chemical substance. [IUPAC: http://goldbook.iupac.org/R05240.html]")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label resource:CHEMINF_000253 "refractive index descriptor")
SubClassOf(resource:CHEMINF_000253 resource:CHEMINF_000025)
